So far, I have the fastest ascension!  Yay!  I don't expect it to
last, though.

It took 12574 turns with a human chaotic wizard.  A level 1 and a
level 3 altar and saccing for Magicbane speeded things up a lot.  Lots
of other things fell into place, too:
two early wishes (Master Key of Thievery and SDSM),
a spellbook of identify,
a wand of cancellation right when I needed it, and
having rings of polymorph and poly control when I reached the
castle.

Made a few mistakes though like forgetting to bring along some cash to
Baelzebub, and chasing after a nymph who stole my key.

